      "content": [],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1091",
      "props": {
        "caption": "parti-werewolf.png",
        "url": "asset:asset_c9703ed1a699d617ad538625"
      },
      "type": "image"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "children": [],
          "content": [
            {
              "styles": {},
              "text": "桌游必不可少的哼哈二将，现在还支持牌盒模式手动发牌，再也不用担心手机被没收了",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1093",
          "props": {},
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "content": [],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1092",
      "props": {},
      "type": "quote"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "当然也绝对少不了经典的回合制游戏，扑克、麻将这些都是基础操作，棋牌游戏完全踩中了Parti的舒适区。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1094",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "斗地主、超级扑克与超级麻将",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1095",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "斗地主超级扑克与超级麻将",
        "level": 3
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1096",
      "props": {
        "caption": "parti-mahjong.png",
        "url": "asset:asset_ae21960b72eff1aa37a946f2"
      },
      "type": "image"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "children": [],
          "content": [
            {
              "styles": {},
              "text": "国民游戏还需要介绍吗",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1098",
          "props": {},
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "content": [],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1097",
      "props": {},
      "type": "quote"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "午夜赌局",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1099",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "午夜赌局",
        "level": 3
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1100",
      "props": {
        "caption": "parti-midnight-wager.png",
        "url": "asset:asset_0d4063a35590162a8ae7a220"
      },
      "type": "image"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "children": [],
          "content": [
            {
              "styles": {},
              "text": "经典骗子酒馆类型游戏，终于不用手动发牌了",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1102",
          "props": {},
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "content": [],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1101",
      "props": {},
      "type": "quote"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "想玩的游戏没有？可以自己做",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1103",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "想玩的游戏没有可以自己做",
        "level": 2
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1104",
      "props": {
        "caption": "parti-editor.png",
        "url": "asset:asset_4d6c4a274e1ff7a4e5c149be"
      },
      "type": "image"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "Parti 也允许导入自定义房间。一个最简的房间只有三个文件：",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1105",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "my-room/\n  parti.room.json\n  index.html\n  room.worker.jstext",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1106",
      "props": {
        "language": "plaintext"
      },
      "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "parti.room.json",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 记录游戏名、人数、入口和权限",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "index.html",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 管界面",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "room.worker.js",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 保存规则和权威状态。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1107",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "你可以从空白房间或模板开始，在编辑器里改，也可以直接导入 ZIP 或者 GitHub 仓库里的房间代码。现在Parti还支持了市场协议（基于GitHub Issue），可以快速把自己开发的游戏发布到Parti中，让更多人能玩到。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1108",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "当然，最简单也是我最推荐的方法，就是直接全部交给AI，Parti 专门有一整套文档供开发者/AI阅读，只需要复制简单的提示词，就能让任何一个有些许Agent技能的AI直接帮你写出完整的游戏，稍微复杂一点，直接让opencode或者Codex代劳，连发布的活都省了。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1109",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "children": [],
          "content": [
            {
              "styles": {},
              "text": "下面就是用 Deepseek 网页版创建的德州扑克和井字棋游戏，啪地一下就搞定了。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1111",
          "props": {},
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "children": [],
          "content": [
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "styles": {
                    "bold": true,
                    "underline": true
                  },
                  "text": "德州扑克",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "href": "https://chat.deepseek.com/share/rxc520fwycjfu7tlen",
              "type": "link"
            }
          ],
          "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1112",
          "props": {},
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "children": [],
          "content": [
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "styles": {
                    "bold": true,
                    "underline": true
                  },
                  "text": "井字棋",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "href": "https://chat.deepseek.com/share/nsachgzkwh3jlvkrtu",
              "type": "link"
            }
          ],
          "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1113",
          "props": {},
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "content": [],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1110",
      "props": {},
      "type": "quote"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "联机是如何实现的",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1114",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "联机是如何实现的",
        "level": 2
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "Parti 的联机原理也非常简单，它本质上就是通过Web RTC进行连接建立和数据传输，只是它把底层的脏活累活都处理好了，开发者只需要关心它的协议，api如何调用，然后专注于自己的逻辑实现。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1115",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "如果是服务器联机游戏开发，核心逻辑代码会运行在云端的服务器上，而在Parti中，由于完全没有服务器做后盾，这部分代码会通过Web Worker运行在房主设备上，并且通过房主连接所有人，承担大部分服务器的工作。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1116",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "children": [],
          "content": [
            {
              "styles": {},
              "text": "房主：既然做好了开房间的准备，就要有承担更多责任的觉悟啊",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1118",
          "props": {},
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "content": [],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1117",
      "props": {},
      "type": "quote"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "这样做的好处是，Parti完全不需要服务器支持，只要 Parti 网页还能访问，就能一直运行下去，一直联机，一直开房间。白嫖到底，这就是开发者的底气（误。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1119",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "Parti 的房间分享功能也是内置的，开发者无需关心，就能自动获得，房间公开性设置、设置密码、二维码/链接分享、局域网公开等基础平台功能开箱即用。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1120",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "集大成者",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1121",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "集大成者",
        "level": 2
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "可以说，Parti 目前几乎把浏览器的能力发挥得淋漓尽致，它的联机能力来自于Web RTC，它的包加载能力依靠 Service Worker 实现，通过 Web Worker 运行游戏服务端逻辑，依靠 Canvas 实现画面渲染，动作传感器权限让重力感应成为可能，如果 Parti 早诞生几年，可能还没有如此广阔的设备支持如此多的新特性，甚至如果不是Codex，Parti如此之多的代码量，协议设计与适配器，开发工作量让人来实现也简直不敢想象。但现如今，随着手机厂商、浏览器厂商的努力，新特性不断普及，AI也越来越好用，正是这些天时地利一贯而出，让 Parti 最终横空出世。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1122",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "并非万能",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1123",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "并非万能",
        "level": 2
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "WebRTC 受运营商、NAT、公司网络和地区连接状况影响很大。有些网络环境就是连不上，或者延迟明显。遇到这种情况，可以试试切到局域网模式，或者让所有设备挂在同一个 Wi-Fi 下。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1124",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "房主的浏览器要干权威计算的活，所以游戏期间房主不能把页面关掉。Parti 也没有竞技级的反作弊能力，它面向的就是朋友聚会、家庭娱乐和轻量社交。房主、玩家设备和房间代码都不能当成绝对可信的环境。说实话，要是跟朋友玩聚会游戏还要开挂，那大概也不是技术能解决的问题了。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1125",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "一些内置游戏还在继续调。动作手感、网络表现、移动端布局、多人流程，都得靠更多真人试玩来磨。如果哪个游戏玩着有问题，欢迎直接反馈。要是你已经改好了，提个 PR 就更好了。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1126",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "开个房间再说",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1127",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "下次聚会直接开个房间吧",
        "level": 2
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "现在 Parti 里有了《Endwell》，还陆续塞进了平台跳跃、炸弹竞技、坦克大战、你画我猜、狼人杀、斗地主和麻将。这些游戏打开浏览器就能玩，朋友离得近就递个二维码，离得远就发条链接。登录注册开会员？不存在的。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1128",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "[Parti 在线体验](",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "styles": {},
              "text": "https://parti.linkai.work/",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "href": "https://parti.linkai.work/",
          "type": "link"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": ")",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1129",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "如果你心里也有一款一直想玩、却始终没能跟朋友联机上的游戏，可以翻翻代码和开发文档：",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1130",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "[Parti GitHub 仓库](",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "styles": {},
              "text": "https://github.com/glink25/partis",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "href": "https://github.com/glink25/partis",
          "type": "link"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": ")",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1131",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "也许 Parti 里的下一款游戏，就来自另一场迟到了很多年的联机。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_8979c7e0c1a0b73a288d658d_b1132",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ],
